ing)\n- Poll URL returns job status, wait for status='completed'\n\n## 9. src/extract/file_handler.py\nUnified file handler that detects file type and routes to appropriate reader:\n- Function read_input_files(filepaths: list[Path], role: str, api_key: str = None) -> dict[str, list[dict]] that:\n  - role is either 'shortages' or 'warehouse'\n  - For each file, detect if PDF or Excel by extension\n  - Route to pdf_reader or excel_reader accordingly\n  - Returns dict mapping filename -> list of extracted items\n  - Each item has: item_name_raw, source_file, source_page/source_row\n\nMake all code clean, with type hints, docstrings, and proper error handling. Use pathlib.Path for all file paths. Print progress messages in Arabic.","Role":"Project structure builder","TypeName":"pharmacy-builder"}],"toolAction":"Building project structure","toolSummary":"Core project files creation"}}]}
